1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,020
There was a season I could only wave hello

2
00:00:02,020 --> 00:00:05,620
Through the screen door at Mama, sitting on the tile below

3
00:00:05,620 --> 00:00:09,220
They'd stand out on the lawn just to see me for a while

4
00:00:09,220 --> 00:00:12,740
And I'd make them all a promise with a tired little smile

5
00:00:12,740 --> 00:00:16,420
Now I got sand between my toes and my arms around them tight

6
00:00:16,420 --> 00:00:19,860
No glass, no screen, no distance, just a bonfire glowing bright

7
00:00:19,860 --> 00:00:21,000
So if I hold you a little longer than you think I should
